answer.worked:
Arc + straight distance:
$$\begin{align*}
L &= \frac{180}{360}\times 2\pi(36.5)+85.332\\
L &= 36.5\pi+85.332\\
L &\approx 200.000\text{ m}\quad\text{(3 d.p.)}
\end{align*}$$

